<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $59-1/4(FIM 300.60).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $59-1/4(FIM 300.60).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-3/4 at $59-1/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 300.60 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed 6.50 markka lower at 297.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended down $1-1/4 at $36-1/2 in New York on Monday. The price per share equals about 92.60 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.20 markka at 90.30.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Wall Street. In Helsinki on Monday, Rauma closed up 0.50 markka at 114.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
